    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The bullet glances off your cheekbone, shattering it. The impact is so powerful a hairline crack forms at the base of your skull as your temporal bone is smashed inward, causing a small cerebral hemorrhage.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3). When the @Condition[Stunned] Conditions have been removed they’ll be replaced by @Condition[Fatigued] (2) which will last for 1d10 days. </p><p>No Extraction is necessary.</p>"
